#: package/contents/ui/SyncEngine.qml:5101
#: package/contents/ui/SyncEngine.qml:5141
msgid "Auto-check %1: adjusted — takes effect the next time the music pauses"
msgstr "Autocontrole %1: bijgesteld — wordt actief zodra de muziek pauzeert"

